%[text] | ![](text:image:33bb) | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet$  visualize genetic differences within a population using dimensionality reduction</p><p></p><p></p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet$ Biology</p><p>$\\bullet$ Machine Learning</p><p>$\\bullet$ Linear Algebra</p> |
